{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e06b8e64b5091e09a474f01ce621e9610c6a06afd794950b7d619c099559eab4","ja":"ええっ！？　これだけあれば十分じゃないかな？\nボク達が一緒に食べても、食べきれないと思うよ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
