{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"837e77c079a532e3f7dfbd3cfd5dac7c1b67deaf67a877089f2823f6fad88041","ja":"わかりました。真さんは引き続き生地をお願いします。\n私はもうちょっと、出汁を調整してみます！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a27638775aa01ed855697e8dbc3a45c54a1319d73c084303462b9fa20ebd3916","ja":"「さて、うどん作りもいよいよ佳境！\nゆでた麵を出汁につけて味見をしています！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"816261cec3fb83157380d2f0ee2002d2d81c1801c96e99b6cdd9f90e8597ce8b","ja":"……麺のコシが足りないかも。ゆで時間が\n長かったのかな……それとも、お塩の量を間違えた？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1586.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1776132c4eec2b04e545c20493ff9e8b5a7cd715b45f99a763de0519e374c0f3","ja":"それに出汁も、あれこれ混ぜすぎて\nかえって味がぼやけてしまった気が……？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
